# 📝 TOEIC Part 5 - Day28

## Question 1

When I arrived at the office, the meeting _____ already started.

A. has
B. had
C. have
D. will have

Answer: B

→ 과거의 기준 시점보다 먼저 발생
→ had started

---

## Question 2

She _____ at the company since 2022.

A. works
B. worked
C. has worked
D. had worked

Answer: C

→ since + 과거 시점
→ 현재까지 계속
→ 현재완료

---

## Question 3

By the time we arrived, the restaurant _____ closed.

A. has
B. had
C. is
D. will

Answer: B

---

## Question 4

I _____ the report already, so you don't need to check it.

A. had finished
B. have finished
C. finish
D. finishing

Answer: B

→ 현재와 연결된 완료
→ 현재완료

---

## Challenge

Before the manager arrived, the employees _____ the meeting room.

A. have prepared
B. prepare
C. had prepared
D. will prepare

Answer: C

---

## Key Point

### 현재완료

have/has + p.p.

→ 과거의 일이 현재와 연결

### 과거완료

had + p.p.

→ 과거의 특정 시점보다 먼저 발생
